r out-edges (767->988, 767->1719; steps 27,28,31,32) lead to 1439/1894 and 183/546 (steps 08,09), none of which are in-neighbours of 1635's only in-partners 106 (in: 922,1682 - step_10), 133 (in: 471,912,1322 - step_11) or 302 (79 in-partners, none of them 988/1719/1439/1894 - step_12), so no alternative 2-3 hop route exists. Overall window volume is high (8,217 events, 1,967 active nodes; step_01) and 302 is a hub, but the endpoints themselves are sparse (7 events each; step_02) and their sparse activity periods do not overlap within the delay budget (steps 25,26). Static connectivity exists, but no \u0394<=600 time-respecting cascade does.", "confidence": 0.85, "evidence": [{"trace_id": "step_01", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_02", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_03", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_04", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_12", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_13", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_14", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_15", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_16", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_18", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_19", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_20", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_21", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_22", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_23", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_24", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_29", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_30", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_08", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_09", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_10", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_11", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_25", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_26", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_31", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_32", "role": "confounder_control"}]}, "raw_final_response": "```json\n{\n  \"task_id\": \"t_9cf28